Here is the translation of your text into Uvl-Code format based on the provided instructions:

```uvl-code
System CI/CD {
    Pipeline {
        Build {
            Mandatory
        }
        UnitTest {
            Mandatory
        }
    }

    DeploymentPipeline {
        Staging {
            MandatoryAfter {
                UnitTest
            }
        }
        Production {
            MandatoryAfter {
                Staging
            }
            MandatoryIfAllPass {
                IntegrationTest
                SecurityScan
            }
        }

        Strategy {
            Canary {
                Monitoring {
                    RollbackTrigger
                }
            }
            BlueGreen {
                RequiresDoubleInfrastructureResources
            }
        }

        HotfixPipeline {
            Bypasses {
                Staging
                IntegrationTest
            }
            Requires {
                ManualQAApproval
            }
            MandatoryIfAllPass {
                SecurityScan
            }
        }
    }
}
```

Please note that Uvl-Code is not a standard programming language but rather a conceptual framework for describing systems. The above translation aims to capture the logic and relationships described in your original text in a structured format.